'''Shadow''' (シャドウ, ''Shadou'', '''Shadow''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy that appears in the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Shadow
|image = E 733.png
|first appearance = [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
Shadow dashes at extreme speeds, and attacks from a very impressive 500 range (with an [[Omni Strike]] reaching up to 550). His damage isn't high on its own, but he compensates with a very fast attack rate of 1.67 seconds, with the only delay being his very short backswing animation, making it difficult to recover any ground against him once the supporting threats manage to push, in spite of his 5 knockbacks and moderate health, as his low stats skyrocket with subsequent stages in his appearances. His [[Immune to Slow|Immunity to Slow]] locks players from abusing said effect to delay him, and while he's vulnerable to pretty much anything else, reaching him is easier said than done.

==Strategy==
In earlier stages, Shadow's damage is rather low, meaning plenty of anti-Dark units like [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] can easily target him. You can also use [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance cats]] to snipe him from a good distance, since he's not posing much of a threat. However, his stat buffs greatly increase the threat he poses, to the point where well-timed rushers are practically required to sneak in hits, such as with [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Neo Cutter Cat]]. Outranging him becomes less and less consistent as he can potentially speedclip whenever if he pushes, putting them within range of his attacks.

